Subject: [PATCH] Fix the pattern to match v2 catalog URI

Signed-off-by: Daniel Jiang <jiangd@vmware.com>
---
 src/server/middleware/pattern_test.go | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/server/middleware/patterns.go     |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 src/server/middleware/pattern_test.go

